{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Arrow Rain",
    "steam_appid": 3565090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.poster.avif?t=1754913843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.webm?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.mp4?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Craft your bow and arrow   by unlocking unique weapon parts that suit your playstyle. The bow and arrow consist of six parts: Limb, handle, string, shaft, fletching, and arrowhead - each modifying it in a unique way. Perhaps a bottle of nails will satisfy your needs or will an old sticky troll booger do the trick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complement your bow with ancient treasures from the past. Prehistoric helmets, old wool socks, mossy chest plates, golden bangles and more will aid you on your journey and enhance your synergies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful omens along your journey. These ancient relics unlock forgotten powers. Collect multiple of the same omen to unlock a unique upgrade. Does your build call for a venomous flask or a prickly meteorite?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters come in all shapes and forms but are bound by families. Each family is represented by powerful bosses which will put you to the ultimate test. How long can you endure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by unlocking the legendary stripy pajama pants or perhaps the nearly unobtainable blood-red eyes. Choose from a variety of trendy hairdos and patterned shirts to impress your friends.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.poster.avif?t=1754913843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.webm?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.mp4?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.poster.avif?t=1754913843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.webm?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/61c6d75fc13144e42a803e8a3ee20c6f.mp4?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Craft your bow and arrow   by unlocking unique weapon parts that suit your playstyle. The bow and arrow consist of six parts: Limb, handle, string, shaft, fletching, and arrowhead - each modifying it in a unique way. Perhaps a bottle of nails will satisfy your needs or will an old sticky troll booger do the trick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complement your bow with ancient treasures from the past. Prehistoric helmets, old wool socks, mossy chest plates, golden bangles and more will aid you on your journey and enhance your synergies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful omens along your journey. These ancient relics unlock forgotten powers. Collect multiple of the same omen to unlock a unique upgrade. Does your build call for a venomous flask or a prickly meteorite?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters come in all shapes and forms but are bound by families. Each family is represented by powerful bosses which will put you to the ultimate test. How long can you endure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself by unlocking the legendary stripy pajama pants or perhaps the nearly unobtainable blood-red eyes. Choose from a variety of trendy hairdos and patterned shirts to impress your friends.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.poster.avif?t=1754913843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.webm?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/308f1da6d46622a1aba6a3738a6ba6d3.mp4?t=1754913843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
